        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="Where the prefetchers train and what holds them back; how a line gets its L1D way and how the SRAM sleeps; what a TLB entry carries and how it is invalidated. Dashed outlines are inferred, dotted are speculative." style="text;html=1;kind=title;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
